#: ../../zh/triton_api/Creation_Ops/arange.md:45
msgid ""
"1.函数用于生成一个[start, end) 的连续整数序列，CUDA要求range=(end-start)必须为2的幂次方。Triton-"
"ascend并无此要求。 2.NV和Triton-ascend都限制end的最大值TRITON_MAX_TENSOR_NUMEL = 1048576 "
"3.arange的输入必须是constant常量，支持uint、int类型的小于1048576（最大值TRITON_MAX_TENSOR_NUMEL "
"）的数值。int64不支持。 4.arange的start 和 end 应大于等于0。"
msgstr ""
"1. This function generates a contiguous integer sequence in [start, end). "
"CUDA requires range=(end-start) to be a power of 2. Triton-ascend has no "
"such requirement. 2. Both NV and Triton-ascend limit the maximum end value "
"to TRITON_MAX_TENSOR_NUMEL = 1048576. 3. arange inputs must be constants, "
"supporting uint and int types with values less than 1048576 (maximum "
"TRITON_MAX_TENSOR_NUMEL). int64 is not supported. 4. arange start and end "
"should be >= 0."

